        "title": "Sacred Hindu Temple",
        "text": "Pashupatinath (lord of all animals, Lord Shiva) temple is an ancient temple situated at the banks of Bagamati river. It is a very sacred place for Hindus. It has unique four face Linga unlike other Lord Shiva temples in India. The wooden carvings on the two tier pagoda style temple are mesmerizing. You can also see the replica of this temple at Bhaktapur Durbar Square. Only Hindus are allowed to enter the temple. Others can see the temple from the other bank of Bagamati river.",
